  "title": "Lattice Named to TIME’s America’s Best Companies 2026 List",
  "summary": "HILLSBORO, Ore. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 9, 2026-- Lattice Semiconductor (NASDAQ: LSCC), the low power programmable leader, today announced that the company was named one of America’s Best Companies 2026 by TIME and Statista Inc. TIME’s annual list is identified based on employee satisfaction,",
